---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/Base.astro'

const meta = {
  description:
    'Privacy policy for rajivharlalka.in: no analytics, no ads, no tracking cookies. What little data exists and why.',
  title: 'Privacy Policy',
}
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
  <div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
    <h1 class="title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      This site collects as little data as possible. There are no analytics scripts, no
      advertising, no third-party trackers, and no tracking cookies of any kind.
    </p>
    <h2 id="what-is-stored">What is stored</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Theme preference.</strong> Your light/dark theme choice is saved in your
        browser's local storage on your own device. It never leaves your browser.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Server logs.</strong> The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may keep
        standard request logs (IP address, user agent, requested URL) for security and
        operational purposes, governed by GitHub's own privacy policy.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Webmentions.</strong> If you publicly link to a post, interactions collected
        via webmention.io (likes, replies, reposts) may be displayed alongside that post. Only
        publicly available information is shown.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id="your-data">Your data</h2>
    <p>
      Since there is no account system, newsletter, or comment database, there is no personal
      data of yours held by this site to access, export, or delete. If you appear in a
      webmention display and would like it removed, contact me and I will hide it.
    </p>
    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Reach me through any channel listed on the
      <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
